@startuml
' Evidence: Laplace-Conventional/src/laplace_conventional/cli.py SHA256 36d0a136f9cbe4f76c959b641b3d9b2dc676619caa633c1b8724fa8ec11f1359
' Evidence: Laplace-Conventional/src/laplace_conventional/prepare.py SHA256 1529c346371ae45e63fe99df28f456d666797409a8ce1e78dbd8959737873fb3
' Evidence: Laplace-Conventional/src/laplace_conventional/corpus.py SHA256 922d2f532b53ba8a717043f5c2a552f4cd97e8fe25ad49563894832f95a3fc6f
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFCFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title Conventional — token shards and dataset report
start
:Load manifest and tokenizer;
:Choose uint16 or uint32 from vocabulary size;
:Derive tokens per shard from byte limit, minimum one;
:Create train and validation shard writers;
while (More accessible trainable nonduplicate records?) is (yes)
 :Normalize/chunk records according to file format;
 :Choose stable-key train/validation split;
 :Encode BOS + text tokens + EOS;
 :Write binary token slices across bounded shard files;
 :Update split counts; add train record length histogram;
endwhile (no)
:Close writers; write dataset-report.json with shard list and quantiles;
:Print report;
stop
legend bottom
JSON/JSONL are canonicalized; CSV/TSV rows become JSON; XML emits depth-two elements;
CoNLL-U groups blank-line-separated records; other text is chunked.
Line endings normalize and blank-only chunks are skipped.
endlegend
footer
Source-reviewed orchestration. Nested semantics remain open; no runtime acceptance
claimed. Preparation and record transformation bodies reviewed. This dataset
representation is not an exact source-byte archival representation. Shards write directly
and no rollback/finally closes the whole pipeline on an intermediate exception. Existing
extra shards in an output directory are not removed by this body.
end footer

@enduml
